      <section data-rv aria-labelledby="t-general">
        <h2 id="t-general">What you read here is general</h2>
        <p>This site shares our plans and general information. We have not yet secured a house and are not accepting residents. Plans, services, and costs may change before we open. Joining the waitlist does not guarantee a bed or a move-in date. We work to keep the site accurate, but we cannot promise it is always current.</p>
