        <p>Nothing here is medical, legal, mental health, or crisis advice. Reading this site does not make you our client or patient. Oasis is not an emergency or crisis-response service. If you are in danger, call <strong>911</strong>. If you are in emotional crisis, call or text <strong>988</strong>.</p>
      </section>

      <section data-rv aria-labelledby="t-gifts">
        <h2 id="t-gifts">Gifts and other sites</h2>
        <p>Gifts are made on Zeffy's own donation page, not on our site. When you click Give, you leave this site, and Zeffy's terms and privacy policy apply there. We do not control other websites and are not responsible for what they say or do. Gifts are tax deductible to the extent allowed by law.</p>
